                                                "sense_id": "a77c9781-627f-3e08-ac92-01fef39824e8",
                                                "text": "A solitary cyclist was coming towards us. His head was down and his shoulders rounded, as he put every ounce of energy that he possessed on to the pedals. He was flying like a racer."
